B.bxx=s(["Pri total premye enskripsyon an. Kite vid pou itilize pri renouv\xe8lman an.","Prix total de la premi\xe8re inscription. Vide : m\xeame prix que le renouvellement.","Total first registration price. Leave blank to use the renewal price."],t.s)
