B.bmI=s(["Retire anplwaye sa a? Anprent li ap efase sou t\xe8minal la nan pwochen senkronizasyon an.","Retirer cet employ\xe9 ? Son empreinte sera effac\xe9e du terminal \xe0 la prochaine synchronisation.","Remove this employee? Their fingerprint will be erased from the terminal at the next sync."],t.s)
